content.text:
Now doDream modifications. Need respect ink for byLoom, tag object, observe player, lastPlayerTouch. Locate block lines. Use edit.

Current:
```
function doDream(raw,byLoom=false){
  const parsed=parseDream(raw||'dream orb');
  parsed.ink=Math.max(3,parsed.ink-discountFor(parsed.fn));
  if(ink<parsed.ink&&!byLoom){toast(...);loomSay('idle');return null;}
  setInk(ink-parsed.ink);
...
  enqueueBuild(()=>{
    g=(Builders[parsed.fn]||Builders.orb)(at);
    g.position.y=groundY(at.x,at.z);
    if(parsed.fn==='bridge'){g.rotation.y=yaw;g.position.y+=.4;}
  },parsed.blurb,()=>{
...
    stats.dreams++; if(byLoom)stats.loomDreams++;
...
    loomMemories.push...
...
    renderQuests(); saveDreams(); updateStatus(); markShadowDirty(2);
  });
  return g;
}
```
Modify:
- Check `if(ink<parsed.ink){ if(!byLoom){toast...;loomSay('idle');} return null; }`
- `lastPlayerTouch=performance.now()` only when !byLoom? yes; if byLoom no.
- Inside builder, after g built, set userData. Note `g` may be auto-tagged `byLoom` from prior? no. Set `g.userData.createdAt=Date.now(); g.userData.byLoom=!!byLoom; g.userData.fn=parsed.fn;`
- On completion near stats, call `loomAutonomy?.observeDream({fn:parsed.fn,island:near.d<...?near.i:undefined,byLoom})`. But `near` currently computed after. Compute before? `near` is used below. Insert after `const near=nearestIsland(at.x,at.z);`, before biome. Use `if(!byLoom&&loomAutonomy) loomAutonomy.observeDream({fn:parsed.fn,island:(near.d<islands[near.i].r+26?near.i:undefined),byLoom:false});`. Need `near.i` valid (islands length > 0). Fine.
- For byLoom, engine already increments stats on perform; no need observe. But doDream might be called by old auto? We'll remove old; only engine; maybe other calls byLoom? None. Keep no.

Also add `lastPlayerTouch` in `dreamFromInput`? doDream enough.

