content.text:
Need renderAutoPane function. We'll add whole autonomy block before main loop. But first modify tick to use engine and support roam/lint. We can add block then tick. Let's build block.

Need define:
- `let loomRoam=null;`
- `const dreamLint=[]; let lintTimer=8;`
- helpers `spawnLint`, `updateLint`, `removeLint`
- `removeDream`, `removePlank`
- `measureClutter`
- `loomTidy`, `loomTend`, `loomScout`, `loomSwarm`, `loomExcavate`
- `loomActions`
- `buildLoomContext`
- instantiate engine
- `applyAutonomyResult`
- `renderAutoPane`
- attach `#autoBtn`, `#stAuto` click to open console auto tab.
- Maybe `window.loomAutonomy` for debugging/tests? Could expose `window.loomAutonomy=loomAutonomy`. Helpful testing and user. Do it.

Need ensure functions used before declaration okay. `renderAutoPane` hoisted. `loomAutonomy` assign at module top null and then at block. `renderAutoPane` references it.

Also `DREAM_LIBRARY` imported.

`buildLoomContext`:
```
function buildLoomContext(){
 const cat=DREAM_LIBRARY.map(d=>{
   const parsed=parseDream(d.word);
   return Object.assign({},d,{cost:Math.max(3,parsed.ink-discountFor(parsed.fn)),discovered:!!discovered[d.fn]});
 });
 const clutter=measureClutter();
 const low=lowestIsland();
 const dist=Object.keys(discovered).length/DREAM_LIBRARY.length;
 return {
  running:$('#intro').classList.contains('hide'),
  ink,maxInk,night,
  idle:(performance.now()-lastPlayerTouch)/1000,
  bioAvg:bioAvg(),
  canExcavate:!!canExcavate(),
  boids:boids.length,swarmJob,
  catalog:cat,
  dreamFloor: Math.max(16, 18+(hasSkill('skyweave')?0:4)),
  dreamInterval: autoIntervalMs()/1000,
  clutter,
  lowIsland: low?low.i:0,
  playerIsland: nearestIsland(player.position.x,player.position.z).i,
  discoveredRatio: dist
 };
}
```
`lowestIsland`:
```
function lowestIsland(){let best=null;biomes.forEach((b,i)=>{if(!islands[i])return;const score=b.bio+ (b.mood||0)*.3 + (b.visit?0: .15); if(!best||score<best.score)best={i,score};}); return best;}
```
Maybe prefer stage? Bio low. Fine.

`measureClutter`:
```
function measureClutter(){
 const echoes=selectable.filter(g=>g.userData.isEcho).length;
 const autos=selectable.filter(g=>g.userData.byLoom&&!g.userData.isEcho).length;
 const planks=bridgePlanks.length; const lint=dreamLint.length;
 const floraLoad=flora.length/Math.max(1,FLORA_MAX);
 const total=selectable.length;
 const removable=Math.max(0,echoes-3)+Math.max(0,autos-8)+Math.max(0,planks-10)+lint+Math.max(0,flora.length-Math.floor(FLORA_MAX*.9));
 const score=clamp(Math.max(0,echoes-3)*.07+Math.max(0,autos-8)*.07+Math.max(0,planks-10)*.04+lint*.045+Math.max(0,floraLoad-.88)*1.2+Math.max(0,total-26)*.035,0,1);
 return {score,removable,echoes,autos,planks,lint,flora:flora.length,floraMax:FLORA_MAX,total};
}
```
At start lint spawns after 8s, score small .045 per lint. To trigger tidy, need score >=? engine guards removable >0, utility = .42+order*1.15; order target .12+clutter*1.08 -> with 1 lint score .045, order ~.17, utility .62. Dream utility .58+curiosity(around .6)*1.05=1.2, so dream prioritized. Tidy will happen when clutter accumulates or if no dream available. Fine; after ~10 lint, score .45 -> order .6, tidy utility 1.1, likely. Or leveling drives care etc. Good. Deep tidy manual.

`spawnLint`:
```
function spawnLint(n=1){
 for(...){
  if(dreamLint.length>=16) break;
  const isl=islands[Math.floor(Math.random()*islands.length)];
  const x=isl.x+rand(-isl.r*.8,isl.r*.8), z=...
  const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TetrahedronGeometry(rand(.12,.22)), new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:pick([...]),transparent:true,opacity:.9}));
  mesh.position.set(x, groundY(x,z)+rand(.3,1.1), z);
  mesh.userData.lint=true; mesh.userData.phase=rand(0,6); mesh.userData.spin=rand(-1,1);
  scene.add(mesh); dreamLint.push(mesh); burst(position, color, 4)? no.
 }
}
```
No burst on spawn.
`updateLint(dt,t)`:
```
lintTimer-=dt;
