for each mesh: rotation.y += dt*.8; mesh.position.y += Math.sin(t*1.7+phase)*dt*.06; maybe drift.
```
Need not accumulate when tab hidden? dt clamps 0.05. Fine.

`removeLint(mesh, count)` on tidy:
