```
But `stats.loomTidies++` should happen only when cleaned>0 for quest. Engine also increments internal. Put only if cleaned. For manual deep if nothing, no increment.
- Avoid `updateStatus` recursion? It's fine.
- `saveDreams` after tidy but engine's serialized mind not saved until saveWorld called; call `saveWorld()` too? saveDreams writes part; `saveWorld` includes mind. If we call both each tidy, fine. But `saveWorld` reads save and writes world with mind. Add at end maybe `saveWorld()`.
