content.text:
I wrote a problematic while loop for lint:
```
if(lintTake>0){while(dreamLint.length&&lintTake>dreamLint.length?false:dreamLint.length>0&&(parts.lintTaken||0)<lintTake){...}}
```
This is confusing and likely precedence bug. Replace with simple:
```
let lintTaken=0;
while(dreamLint.length && lintTaken<lintTake){removeLint(dreamLint[0]); cleaned++; lintTaken++;}
if(lintTaken) parts.push(lintTaken+' dream-lint');
```
Fix.

